<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">* Unit counts in Tables 1 and 2 above
reflect adjustments as a result of the PubCo&#8239;Reverse Stock Split and rounding down to the nearest whole Unit, which represents
