records will be updated to reflect the actual number of issued and outstanding Common Units, PI Units and EO Units as of the
PubCo&#8239;RSS Effective Time, including to reflect any issuances, cancellations or forfeitures of Units or interests prior to or
as of the PubCo&#8239;RSS Effective Time.</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">** Hurdle Amounts in the Table 2 above reflect the Hurdle Amount as
of the Effective Time, <I>multiplied by</I> the inverse of the PubCo&#8239;RSS Ratio, and rounded down to the nearest whole cent.</P>

